<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mozilla Support</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    color: #15141a;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 40px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f4;
  }
  .logo {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-right: 60px;
    color: #000;
  }
  .logo strong {
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  nav a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #15141a;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .header-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
  }
  .btn {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-blue {
    background-color: #0060df;
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
  }
  .btn-outline {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #0060df;
    border: 1px solid #0060df;
  }
  .hero {
    background-color: #f9f9fb;
    padding: 80px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    color: #15141a;
    margin: 0 0 30px 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .search-box {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #8f8f9d;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .search-box input {
    flex-grow: 1;
    border: none;
    outline: none;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #15141a;
  }
  .search-box input::placeholder {
    color: #5b5b66;
  }
  .search-icon {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    fill: #5b5b66;
  }
  .popular {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #5b5b66;
  }
  .popular a {
    color: #0060df;
    text-decoration: underline;
    margin-left: 10px;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 20px;
  }
  section {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #15141a;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }
  .subtitle {
    color: #5b5b66;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 0 0 30px 0;
  }
  .grid-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .grid-4 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
  }
  .product-card {
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .placeholder {
    background-color: #f0f0f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #5b5b66;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px dashed #8f8f9d;
  }
  .product-icon {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .card-text h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    color: #15141a;
  }
  .card-text p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #5b5b66;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .article-card {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    min-height: 180px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .doc-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    fill: #15141a;
  }
  .article-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #15141a;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">
    <strong>Mozilla</strong><br>Support
  </div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#">Explore Help Articles</a>
    <a href="#">Community Forums</a>
    <a href="#">Ask a Question</a>
    <a href="#">Contribute</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="header-actions">
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-blue">Download Firefox</a>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Sign In/Up</a>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Search Support</h1>
  <div class="search-box">
    <input type="text" placeholder="Search questions, articles, or topics (example: saving passwords in Firefox)">
    <svg class="search-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <path d="M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27C15.41 12.59 16 11.11 16 9.5 16 5.91 13.09 3 9.5 3S3 5.91 3 9.5 5.91 16 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="popular">
    Popular Searches: 
    <a href="#">Mozilla account</a> 
    <a href="#">VPN</a> 
    <a href="#">Tracking Protection</a> 
    <a href="#">Windows 10</a>
  </div>
</div>

<main>
  <section>
    <h2>Get Help</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Pick your product</p>

    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Firefox Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Firefox</h3>
          <p>Web browser for Windows, Mac and Linux</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Firefox Android Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Firefox for Android</h3>
          <p>Web browser for Android smartphones and tablets</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Firefox iOS Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Firefox for iOS</h3>
          <p>Firefox for iPhone, iPad and iPod touch devices</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Mozilla VPN Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Mozilla VPN</h3>
          <p>VPN for Windows, Mac, Linux, Android, and iOS devices</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Firefox Relay Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Firefox Relay</h3>
          <p>Service that lets you create email masks to hide your real email address</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Mozilla Monitor Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Mozilla Monitor</h3>
          <p>Find out if your private information has been exposed in a known data breach</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[MDN Plus Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>MDN Plus</h3>
          <p>MDN Plus provides a custom user experience for MDN supporters</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Firefox Focus Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Firefox Focus</h3>
          <p>Automatic privacy browser and content blocker</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Firefox Enterprise Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Firefox for Enterprise</h3>
          <p>Firefox Quantum for businesses</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Thunderbird Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Thunderbird</h3>
          <p>Email software for Windows, Mac and Linux</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card product-card">
        <div class="placeholder product-icon">[Thunderbird Android Logo]</div>
        <div class="card-text">
          <h3>Thunderbird for Android</h3>
          <p>Email app for Android smartphones and tablets</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Featured Articles</h2>

    <div class="grid-4">
      <div class="card article-card">
        <svg class="doc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z"/>
        </svg>
        <h3>What Windows 10 end of support means for Firefox users</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="card article-card">
        <svg class="doc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z"/>
        </svg>
        <h3>Secure connection and security warning error pages in Firefox</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="card article-card">
        <svg class="doc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z"/>
        </svg>
        <h3>Make Firefox your default browser on Windows</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="card article-card">
        <svg class="doc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z"/>
        </svg>
        <h3>Insecure connection password warning in Firefox</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

</body>
</html>
